How would you optimize ArrayList performance for 10M elements?
▼
Key manager-level talking points:
1) Pre-size with new ArrayList<>(10_000_000) — eliminates 24 resize operations.
2) Use primitive arrays or IntArrayList (Eclipse Collections, Trove) to avoid boxing overhead.
3) Batch operations via addAll() instead of individual add() in loops.
4) For parallel processing, split using subList() and process in ForkJoinPool.
5) Consider off-heap (Chronicle Map) if GC pause is a concern.